 is not a slinku'i!
> =20
> So, we must go back to the original slinkuhi rule, and we add instead thr=
ee final cases to the rafsi-string rule:
> =20
> slinkuhi <- consonant rafsi-string rafsi-string <- y-less-rafsi* (gismu /=
 CVV-final-rafsi / stressed-y-less-rafsi short-final-rafsi / y-rafsi / stre=
ssed-y-rafsi / stressed-y-less-rafsi? initial-pair y / long-rafsi vowel h y=
 / CCV-rafsi h y / CVV-rafsi h y) =20
